title: Sunday morning riverside walk
summary: An easy-paced 90-minute walk, ending with an optional tea. Good for first-timers.
description: |
  We meet at the gate, say hello, and walk at the pace of the slowest walker.
  Conversation is welcome but never expected. If you'd rather just walk, that's fine.
